        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Édouard Roger-Vasselin, Julien Benneteau, Heather Watson, Nicolas Mahut, Paul Hanley, Jamie Murray\n- Events: Roland Garros 2014, 2012 Open Sud de France – Doubles\n- Roles: tennis players, Wimbledon Mixed Doubles Champion\n- Places: France\n\nFacts:\n- Édouard Roger-Vasselin was born on 28 November 1983 and is a male tennis player from France.\n- Heather Miriam Watson was born on 19 May 1992 and is a British tennis player and a Wimbledon Mixed Doubles Champion.\n- Nicolas Mahut and Édouard Roger-Vasselin won the 2012 Open Sud de France doubles final by defeating third-seeded Paul Hanley and Jamie Murray 6–4, 7–6.\n- Édouard Roger-Vasselin won the men's doubles title at Roland Garros in 2014 with partner Julien Benneteau.",
